#: ../../source/reference/liteframe/generated/maxframe.liteframe.LiteFrame.str.extract.rst:2
msgid "maxframe.liteframe.LiteFrame.str.extract"
msgstr ""

#: of pandas.core.strings.accessor.StringMethods.extract:1
msgid "Extract capture groups in the regex `pat` as columns in a DataFrame."
msgstr "将正则表达式 `pat` 中的捕获组提取为 DataFrame 中的列。"

#: of pandas.core.strings.accessor.StringMethods.extract:3
msgid ""
"For each subject string in the Series, extract groups from the first "
"match of regular expression `pat`."
msgstr "对于 Series 中的每个字符串，从正则表达式 `pat` 的第一次匹配中提取组。"

#: ../../source/reference/liteframe/generated/maxframe.liteframe.LiteFrame.str.extract.rst
msgid "参数"
msgstr ""

#: of pandas.core.strings.accessor.StringMethods.extract:6
msgid "Regular expression pattern with capturing groups."
msgstr "带有捕获组的正则表达式模式。"

#: of pandas.core.strings.accessor.StringMethods.extract:8
msgid ""
"Flags from the ``re`` module, e.g. ``re.IGNORECASE``, that modify regular"
" expression matching for things like case, spaces, etc. For more details,"
" see :mod:`re`."
msgstr ""
"来自 ``re`` 模块的标志，例如 ``re.IGNORECASE``，用于修改正则表达式匹配的"
"大小写、空格等。有关更多详细信息，请参见 :mod:`re`。"

#: of pandas.core.strings.accessor.StringMethods.extract:12
msgid ""
"If True, return DataFrame with one column per capture group. If False, "
"return a Series/Index if there is one capture group or DataFrame if there"
" are multiple capture groups."
msgstr ""
"如果为 True，则返回每捕获组一列的 DataFrame。如果为 False，如果有单个捕获"
"组则返回 Series/Index，如果有多个捕获组则返回 DataFrame。"

#: ../../source/reference/liteframe/generated/maxframe.liteframe.LiteFrame.str.extract.rst
msgid "返回"
msgstr ""

#: of pandas.core.strings.accessor.StringMethods.extract:17
msgid ""
"A DataFrame with one row for each subject string, and one column for each"
" group. Any capture group names in regular expression pat will be used "
"for column names; otherwise capture group numbers will be used. The dtype"
" of each result column is always object, even when no match is found. If "
"``expand=False`` and pat has only one capture group, then return a Series"
" (if subject is a Series) or Index (if subject is an Index)."
msgstr ""
"一个 DataFrame，每个字符串对应一行，每个组对应一列。正则表达式 pat 中的"
"任何捕获组名称都将用作列名；否则将使用捕获组编号。即使未找到匹配项，每个"
"结果列的数据类型始终为 object。如果 ``expand=False`` 且 pat 只有一个捕获"
"组，则返回 Series（如果 subject 是 Series）或 Index（如果 subject 是 "
"Index）。"

#: ../../source/reference/liteframe/generated/maxframe.liteframe.LiteFrame.str.extract.rst
msgid "返回类型"
msgstr ""

#: of pandas.core.strings.accessor.StringMethods.extract:29
msgid ":py:obj:`extractall`"
msgstr ""

#: of pandas.core.strings.accessor.StringMethods.extract:30
msgid "Returns all matches (not just the first match)."
msgstr "返回所有匹配项（不仅仅是第一次匹配）。"

